hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1386.1","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"
"1386.2","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"
"1387.1",""
"1387.2","Malik related to me from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman from his father from his father that Uthman ibn Affan gave him some money as qirad to use provided the profit was shared between them"
